<title>FRANCE: French Cogema 1996 net attrib up, oper profit down.</title>
<headline>French Cogema 1996 net attrib up, oper profit down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cogema, the French state-owned nuclear materials group, said on Thursday 1996 net attributable profit rose slightly to 977 million francs from 973 million.</p>
<p>Consolidated turnover advanced 12.5 percent, or 10.7 percent like-for-like, to 34.427 billion francs, it said. But operating profit fell to 1.257 billion francs from 1.621 billion in 1995, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
